# Build and system artifacts
.build/
*.swp
*~
Thumbs.db
.env.local

# Generated plugin output — rebuild with Scripts/build-plugin.sh
dist/

# Task artifacts from the CLAUDE.md pipeline (Scripts/claude-workflows/). Per-run
# working state: phase outputs, extracted snippets, pre-edit backups. The scripts
# are tracked; what a particular run produced is not.
.claude/claude-tasks/

# Lifecycle state. In a CONSUMER repo .genericarch/ is tracked — the manifest, the tombstones and
# the step ledger are the record of what was installed and what was declined. In THIS repo there is
# no install, so the ledger ga-step.sh derives is local noise.
.genericarch/
